            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThis is, of course, possible. However, I don't think this is a good idea. My reasoning is that starting a picker should *always* result into showing a picker (as stated in #809 with a bit more thoughts in [this comment](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/550#issuecomment-1792044864)).\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
